# Overrides .env for `npm run dev` only (Vite loads `.env.[mode]` on top of
# `.env`). Local dev serves the bundle you just built from the SDK root
# (`fvm flutter build web --target=lib/main_web.dart --no-web-resources-cdn`)
# through the `build_web` symlink, never the CDN, which can drift from your
# working tree's host contract. `npm run build` still uses the CDN via `.env`.
VITE_SDK_ASSET_BASE=/build_web/
